As far as making lessons is concerned, not at this point, no. They're
supposedly working on that. Before they went through a major site change, it
was possible to upload a list, thus creating an entire lesson in one go. The
site has stated that it will be bringing that feature back at some point.

As far as a site for *learning* lessons is concerned, though, smart.fm is
actually really good- good enough for me to put up with the current
inadequacies of the lesson making interface.

